WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.374
The morning bugle call was echoing through camp.

2
00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:07.525
Ivy groaned as she opened her eyes.

3
00:00:07.526 --> 00:00:12.589
Willow and Clara were already up, making their beds before morning inspection. ​

4
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.931
Penelope was wide awake too.

5
00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:19.805
"Let's talk about the talent show next week, girls! Come on, Ivy."

6
00:00:19.806 --> 00:00:24.115
Ivy dragged herself out of bed.

7
00:00:24.116 --> 00:00:27.610
The three younger girls gathered around Penelope.

8
00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:31.513
"Each cabin usually does an act together," Penelope said.

9
00:00:31.514 --> 00:00:35.590
"It would be great if . . ." She smiled hopefully at them.

10
00:00:35.591 --> 00:00:38.624
"You three did something together."

11
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:44.624
"Ugh!" Ivy thought. "Another group activity."

12
00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:50.232
Clara shot a nervous glance at Ivy. "That sounds fun."

13
00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:53.248
"Great!" Penelope beamed.

14
00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:55.323
"I have to go help with breakfast.

15
00:00:55.324 --> 00:01:04.249
I know you'll come up with an awesome act for the show. See you later!"

16
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:09.573
"Ivy, any ideas for an act we can do together?" Clara asked.

17
00:01:09.574 --> 00:01:15.190
Ivy shrugged. "Are you guys good at drawing vampires?" "Um.

18
00:01:15.191 --> 00:01:20.519
That's not really a talent show act," Clara said. "But

19
00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.728
never mind. We have time to think of something." Willow

20
00:01:24.729 --> 00:01:29.288
nodded. "We're going to volleyball this morning. You

21
00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:34.492
should come too, Ivy. We could plan our act between the games." "Oh—um,

22
00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:38.712
sorry!" Ivy said. "I

23
00:01:38.713 --> 00:01:42.597
promised Ezra and Glen I'd go hiking with them." Ivy

24
00:01:42.598 --> 00:01:46.402
tried not to look happy about having an excuse. She

25
00:01:46.403 --> 00:01:50.541
needed some time apart from her cabinmates to think of a plan. There

26
00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:54.666
was no way she was doing an act with them. "Okay,"

27
00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:57.271
Clara said. "But

28
00:01:57.272 --> 00:02:03.124
let's meet back here later to discuss it. It'll be such a blast!" "You

29
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:07.641
mean, it'll be such a nightmare," Ivy thought. ***

30
00:02:07.642 --> 00:02:12.166
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra walked along the trail with the other hikers.

31
00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:15.925
Mango was looking through his binoculars.

32
00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:19.600
"I really want to spot a painted lady butterfly.

33
00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:22.462
I haven't seen one all summer."

34
00:02:22.463 --> 00:02:27.237
The Ucks were practicing football tackles and bumping into everyone.

35
00:02:27.238 --> 00:02:30.865
"What's up with this talent show?" Ivy asked.

36
00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:34.564
"Penelope said we have to do an act with our cabin.

37
00:02:34.565 --> 00:02:39.469
If I have to be in a talent show, I'd rather do something alone.

38
00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.082
Or maybe with you guys."

39
00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:46.332
"Of course you would rather do an act with me!" Glen said.

40
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:52.166
"I'm amazingly talented! And I know everything about this camp!"

41
00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:58.749
Ezra shrugged. "The talent show is something cabinmates always do together."

42
00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.684
Ivy gritted her teeth.

43
00:03:00.685 --> 00:03:07.112
"Another activity I'm forced to do. What's your cabin doing?"

44
00:03:07.113 --> 00:03:12.910
Glen grinned. "I'm going to write a comedy routine for Ezra, Wes Wheezer, and me.

45
00:03:12.911 --> 00:03:19.166
I'm number one at writing comedy. So we're definitely going to win the prize." "As

46
00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:22.791
long as it's funny," Ezra said. "Trust

47
00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:29.499
me, it will be," Glen said. "Check out this joke. Knock, knock!" "Who's

48
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.457
there?" Ezra asked. "Glen

49
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:35.383
S.," Glen said. "Glen

50
00:03:35.384 --> 00:03:38.967
S. who?" Ezra asked. "Glen

51
00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:45.999
S. the funniest guy ever!" Glen laughed loudly. Ivy

52
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:55.707
groaned. "That's the worst knock, knock joke ever!" Ezra

53
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:59.303
panted as they started up a steep hill. "Ivy,

54
00:03:59.304 --> 00:04:03.332
you should just do an act with Clara and Willow. They're

55
00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:07.457
nice. And I bet the act will be good." "I

56
00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:11.816
don't like nice ," Ivy said.

57
00:04:11.817 --> 00:04:14.791
"I like creepy and weird.

58
00:04:14.792 --> 00:04:18.490
That's why I'm friends with you two, remember?"

59
00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:21.724
Glen frowned. "I'm not—"

60
00:04:21.725 --> 00:04:24.504
"A painted lady!" Mango shouted.

61
00:04:24.505 --> 00:04:28.383
He stopped in his tracks and stared through his binoculars.

62
00:04:28.384 --> 00:04:31.311
Bam! The Ucks crashed right into him.

63
00:04:31.312 --> 00:04:33.811
"Ahh!" Mango yelled.

64
00:04:33.812 --> 00:04:39.475
Ivy stared in shock as Mango tumbled down the hill!

